  "idea": "Stripe Billing 2.0 updates for metered usage and automated tax",
  "text": "These new Stripe features completely simplify recurring customer invoices for modern agencies. Chasing unpaid invoices and manually adjusting prorated contract changes eats up dozens of billable hours every month. Outdated accounting software lacks automatic retries, causing failed credit card payments to churn valuable clients. Stripe Smart Retries uses machine learning to recover failed charges while customer portals allow self-service card updates. You get invoices paid in twenty-four hours.",
